---
title: Beet and Almond Butter Soup
image: https://tfpj-s3.troisfoisparjour.com/app/uploads/2018/08/19222110/Potage_Betteraves_Gingembre_L.jpg
servings: 6
author: Trois fois par jour
prep time: 20 min
cook time: 30 min
---

In a large pot, sauté the @yellow onion{1}(roughly chopped) in the @butter{2%tbsp} for ~{5%minutes}, or until translucent. Season.

Add the @beets{3%cups}(peeled and cubed), the @potato{1}(peeled and cubed) and the @balsamic vinegar{2 tbsp}, then continue cooking for ~{2%minutes}.

Add the @chicken broth{4%cups}, the @almond butter{1/4%cup} and the @cream (15% or 35%){1/2%cup}. Bring to a boil, then simmer over low heat for ~{30%minutes}.

Using a food processor or an immersion blender, purée everything until smooth. Adjust the seasoning if needed, then serve with the @sliced almonds{1/4%cup}(toasted, for garnish).